    "updated_at": "2024-08-22T13:40:21Z",
    "body": "> can this be changed in Chromium/V8? See [#237 (comment)](https://github.com/whatwg/console/pull/237#issuecomment-2292207723) above.\r\n\r\nWe can definitely update Chromium accordingly, but I wonder if that wouldn't be considered a regression. Being able to print objects (with non-indexed properties) as tables could be useful for some users. Is there some data that we can base the decision to stick to just indexed properties on?",
